# Local Portal — future design backlog

Spec: `docs/modules/LOCAL_PORTAL.md`. Plan: `.cursor/plans/local_portal_future.plan.md`.

## Shipped in memory (P3 + P4 — 2026-07-22)

- **Momentum**, **Sidebars**, **Fronts**
- Cross-Circle search, Station week digest, per-Circle unread badges
- Circle templates (LEC / JHSC / campaign), Bulletin pin + comments UI
- Calendar `.ics` download, Roster invite (demo users), Roll Call question create (API + UI)
- Deep-link Station/search hits via `?tab=`, Fronts date edit on Circle, Action assignee/due, Calendar datetime/location
- **P4:** @mentions → Dispatch, soft-delete + Circle audit, per-tool mute, Pipeline drag-and-drop, Basecamp CSV import, activity pack export, keyboard 1–0 tool switch, Calendar RSVP/external URL, guest (viewer) banner

## Production cutover (blocking)

1. Postgres + RLS on `unionId` / `localId` / `circleId`
2. Binder object storage + virus scan (reuse Phase 7 attachment path)
3. Invite / Roster UI (email transactional — ARCHITECTURE v2+)
4. Replace memory adapter; seed migration from demo Circles

## Still deferred

- **Email → Bulletin** — after retention/privacy ADR
- Dispatch digest email (transactional)
- Calendar link to live `UnionMeeting` / `/r/[token]` RSVP (external URL field ships as interim)
- Realtime Floor (SSE first) — keep calm, not Slack
- Guest visibility auto-admit for `local_members` Circles without explicit Roster

## Explicit non-goals (still)

- Grievance notes / bumping strategy in Portal
- `/member` routes or national ERP replacement
- Basecamp brand names in UI
- Marketing email / analytics
- Full Slack/Teams replacement

## Testing expectations when touching Portal

- `npm run lint` + `npm run typecheck` + `npm run test:unit`
- `npm run test:smoke` (includes `e2e/portal.smoke.spec.ts` `@smoke`)
- Keep axe serious/critical clean on Station + Circle workspace
